<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-13T16:11:18.790Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:11:18 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican gang members kidnapped local officials to force the release of a detained associate, while U.S. sanctions targeted four individuals and eleven entities tied to a cartel's commercial network. A Tijuana cannabis grower launched a legal operation aimed at the Sinaloa cartel, and cartel leaders sought luxury vehicles and U.S. rental cars for cross-border use. A mysterious fuel depot in Hidalgo is suspected of supporting the Jalisco New Generation Cartel, and a hunter-fire bullet killed a father of five in his home. 37 battle-related deaths occurred in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBuR3R3SFZReE52WVpId0NHc015TnVwdGwySy05d1A3N01zUjhYYTJIUGlwbzQ5UWtzZGRmN2c3TGtPX2l5R3lLUWVTNUlDRUo2MGNKMTlxZEM4Wkc4QXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxQRk8tVlAzWjJIVFRsWklIRWVDVVJBU2EzcTlvalNWWTdfUnA4R2tfSHhMaDFmRXBQWFpacTFPcVIwRnZaRHFkV0RDLVI0dTVKQ1dwZzlkeTNUMjNyV2EzVG43WjhqU1ptSVI4alZmOC0zSUJKQUZwbi00WFcxeDQtNWRIV0dfOHJVY1JJczgxUm4xeUo0RDFFTmhpTzg1eENGeWFNLXRhMFN0REI2ZnpGdWMxRUFVOExmYi1jM3RmbDliLTU2a3Yw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPb0tUeVFxcW9VUmZjX0I4LWsxU29pYWQ0b0ZkdjNLaTkwX1BWRF94RDhWMkpvOG9pdkhrVTB1MTNtRjd4aVI1SVJkZ09namxtdWt1MVBhelpXTXlvN0hud0YyMmgxalVyUDNmY0R5UEhEYVZQdFJGMGxoNzBYZTQtc3dRM21HelRseHl1blRRTktkRXBZLVRrUFVoODdqVExwZXIzMTdTa2E3b2hXTFQ1U2ZxSkhqQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNTEpPUDNEemNoNFNYWVo3WWhqekNJSk83UmhxeG9CNU5tYVpwYnFBNVVvcnVUeUhqYWJZZlRZTThiZGwzRzBZV2F6bmNENDh4SllqdkJQSjVnV1lRdlFNTFFXZXdOWGhWWjRHYVRzX0J6MGNhWDNRak1XVGdxZG9fc04yVkFmU2RodnpCaGZKOFRvX0czaHVpbHZ1R2VoMDNDaXBaNWlQd3ZRQm1xRkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;MMJDaily&lt;/a&gt;, &l